# NetHubKe monorepo — use package-specific examples (do not put secrets here):
#   apps/backend/.env.example  → apps/backend/.env.local
#   apps/frontend/.env.example → apps/frontend/.env.local
#
# Typical local ports:
#   Frontend  http://localhost:3000
#   Backend   http://localhost:8000
#   Postgres  localhost:5432
#   OIDC IdP  https://auth.nethub.co.ke (Zitadel)
#   Redis     localhost:6379
#
# Auth flow: register user in Zitadel → login on NetHub (OIDC) → /users/sync
# Frontend callback: {NEXTAUTH_URL}/api/auth/callback/oidc
